(MAS FINAL PROJECT: OVERVIEW AND ARCHITECTURE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. PROJECT PURPOSE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This project implements a deterministic multi-agent warehouse system where robots:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  ? navigate on a 2D grid,) Tj
T*
(  ? pick requested shelves,) Tj
T*
(  ? deliver requested shelves to goal cells,) Tj
T*
(  ? avoid collisions through cooperative planning,) Tj
T*
(  ? improve safety through verification-guided refinement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The system is intentionally algorithmic \(not ML-policy-driven\).) Tj
T*
(Core claim: practical multi-agent coordination can be built with explicit planning +) Tj
T*
(symmetry-reduced verification + constraint refinement.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(2. WHAT THE SYSTEM CONTAINS) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Core runtime modules:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  ? main.py: CLI entrypoint and orchestration.) Tj
T*
(  ? env.py: environment dynamics, reward/collision handling, rendering, evaluation.) Tj
T*
(  ? agent.py: robot/action primitives and pick/drop semantics.) Tj
T*
(  ? pathfinding.py: cooperative planner and assignment logic.) Tj
T*
(  ? symmetry_reduction.py: role-orbit detection and canonical state mapping.) Tj
T*
(  ? verification.py: bounded safety verification over quotient states.) Tj
T*
(  ? refinement.py: conversion of unsafe traces into planner constraints.) Tj
T*
(  ? config.py + config.yaml: defaults and runtime overrides.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Support:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  ? tests/: module and integration tests.) Tj
T*
(  ? docs/: documentation site and written docs.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(3. ARCHITECTURAL STYLE) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(The architecture is a deterministic closed loop:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(1. Planner computes one action per robot.) Tj
T*
(2. Environment executes actions simultaneously with conflict resolution.) Tj
T*
(3. Verification optionally runs bounded trials on symmetry-reduced state keys.) Tj
T*
(4. Refinement optionally injects hard constraints back into planner.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(This forms a CEGAR-like pattern:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  ? generate behavior,) Tj
T*
(  ? detect violations,) Tj
T*
(  ? refine constraints,) Tj
T*
(  ? repeat.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. EXECUTION MODES \(FROM MAIN.PY\)) Tj
T*
() Tj
ET
endstream
