(15. COMPLEXITY AND SCALABILITY NOTES) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(Major computational costs:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  ? Planner:) Tj
T*
(  - one bounded A* per robot per timestep,) Tj
T*
(  - plus assignment matching.) Tj
T*
(  ? Verification:) Tj
T*
(  - trials * horizon worst-case steps,) Tj
T*
(  - each step calls planner and environment dynamics.) Tj
T*
(  ? Symmetry:) Tj
T*
(  - canonicalization overhead is small relative to planning,) Tj
T*
(  - potential benefit depends on how frequently symmetric permutations occur.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
