T*
() Tj
T*
(Current design limitations:) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(  ? Bounded verification, not full proof of global safety.) Tj
T*
(  ? Symmetry reduction is role-based, not geometric-map automorphism-based.) Tj
T*
(  ? Refinement currently translates a limited conflict vocabulary.) Tj
T*
(  ? Performance sensitivity to congestion, horizon, and node caps.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(These are engineering tradeoffs for tractability and transparency.) Tj
T*
() Tj
